From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:01 2001
From: vamos <vamos@comma.ai>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 20:00:00 -0700
Subject: cam: quiesce NACK-era diagnostics (pr_emerg->pr_debug, drop probe holds)

The sensor NACK is solved (PM8998 L8). The diagnostic patch stack's
pr_emerg breadcrumbs (334 sites, level 0 = unfilterable) flood the
115200 serial console during every camera run, and the two 3s probe
holds add ~6s per sensor. Downgrade every vamos-* pr_emerg to pr_debug
and delete the msleep(3000) holds. Applied last so the diagnostic
patches themselves stay untouched; a proper series cleanup is M5 work.
---

